<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Sulzer.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Sulzer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued three million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Sulzer AG, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,050 CHF		 PREMIUM	16.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.0 CHF		   GEARING	9.85 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.AUG.97		 PAYDATE	05.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 20</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  985 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
